# sys-turnback-timeout (decomp ScrCmd_InitTurnbackCave). A constructed start: one pillar
# seen and 29 rooms visited, the player at a pillar-1 room's south door; its onTransition adds the 30th room, so every
# other door leads back to the entrance (the decomp's timeout), whose onTransition clears both counters. Out by the
# entrance's south door to Sendoff Spring.
set var platinum:VAR_TURNBACK_CAVE_PILLARS_SEEN 1
set var platinum:VAR_TURNBACK_CAVE_ROOMS_VISITED 29
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_TURNBACK_CAVE_PILLAR_1_ROOM_1 11 20 up
until idle
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_TURNBACK_CAVE_PILLARS_SEEN 1
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_TURNBACK_CAVE_ROOMS_VISITED 30
# The east door (20,11): up a row, right to the aisle, up to the door's row, then right into it.
+0 press up
until position 11 19
+0 release up
+0 press right
until position 19 19
+0 release right
+0 press up
until position 19 11
+0 release up
+0 press right
until position 2 11 300
+0 release right
until idle 300
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_TURNBACK_CAVE_ENTRANCE 2 11
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_TURNBACK_CAVE_PILLARS_SEEN 0
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_TURNBACK_CAVE_ROOMS_VISITED 0
# Out to Sendoff Spring: up the west aisle, through the gap at the top, round the inscription to its south door (11,16).
+0 press right
until position 3 11
+0 release right
+0 press up
until position 3 3
+0 release up
+0 press right
until position 11 3
+0 release right
+0 press down
until position 11 12
+0 release down
+0 press left
until position 7 12
+0 release left
+0 press down
until position 7 15
+0 release down
+0 press right
until position 11 15
+0 release right
+0 press down
until position 31 16 300
+0 release down
until idle 300
+0 assert map platinum:MAP_HEADER_SENDOFF_SPRING
